parameters.jsonBody:
={
  "contents": [
    {
      "parts": [
        {
          "text": "You are a highly capable engineering assistant. I will provide a multi-page PDF containing 2D CAD drawings for multiple product parts, such as a perfume bottle cap and a spray head.\n\nEach part may be spread across multiple pages, and each drawing contains dimensions and tolerances. Some parts are meant to fit into or around each other, so their interior and exterior dimensions must match within tolerance limits.\n\nYour task is to:\n\n1. Read all pages first\nUnderstand which drawings relate to which parts, even if they appear on different pages.\nIdentify part names, views, and any sub-assemblies or details.\n\n2. Extract and organize dimensional data\nFor each part, extract:\n- Part name (or inferred ID like \"Unknown Part #1\")\n- Pages it appears on\n- All dimensional features:\n  - Feature name or description (e.g., \"inner diameter of socket\")\n  - Value\n  - Tolerance (± or limit-based)\n  - Unit (e.g., mm)\n  - Dimension type:\n    - \"radius\" (starts with R)\n    - \"diameter\" (starts with Ø)\n    - \"length\" (linear, height/width/etc.)\n  - Is critical dimension (the dimension need to care about)(true if the value is inside a square or rectangle; otherwise false)\n  - Whether it's an interior or exterior dimension\n\nUse this format:\n{\n  \"part_name\": \"Cap\",\n  \"pages\": [1, 2],\n  \"dimensions\": [\n    {\n      \"feature\": \"Inner Diameter (for spray fit)\",\n      \"value\": 12.0,\n      \"tolerance\": \"±0.1\",\n      \"unit\": \"mm\",\n      \"type\": \"interior\",\n      \"dimension_type\": \"diameter\",\n      \"is_critical_dimension\": true\n    },\n    {\n      \"feature\": \"Cap Height\",\n      \"value\": 20.0,\n      \"tolerance\": null,\n      \"unit\": \"mm\",\n      \"type\": \"exterior\",\n      \"dimension_type\": \"length\",\n      \"is_critical_dimension\": false\n    }\n  ]\n}\n\n3. Detect matching/contact dimensions across parts\nAfter extracting all part dimensions:\n- Identify potential mating/contact pairs — e.g., one part’s inner diameter matches another part’s outer diameter.\n- Consider tolerances.\n\nOutput format:\n{\n  \"contact_pair\": {\n    \"part_a\": \"Cap\",\n    \"feature_a\": \"Inner Diameter (for spray fit)\",\n    \"value_a\": 12.0,\n    \"tolerance_a\": \"±0.1\",\n    \"type_a\": \"interior\",\n    \"part_b\": \"Spray Head\",\n    \"feature_b\": \"Outer Diameter (spray base)\",\n    \"value_b\": 12.05,\n    \"tolerance_b\": \"±0.05\",\n    \"type_b\": \"exterior\",\n    \"fit_status\": \"likely compatible\"\n  }\n}\n\n4. Make assumptions clear\n- Label missing part names.\n- Flag missing units or tolerances.\n- Explain if a fit is ambiguous."
        },
        {
          "file_data": {
            "mime_type": "{{ $json.file.mimeType }}",
            "file_uri": "{{ $json.file.uri }}"
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
  "generationConfig": {
    "responseMimeType": "application/json",
    "responseSchema": {
      "type": "object",
      "properties": {
        "parts": {
          "type": "array",
          "items": {
            "type": "object",
            "properties": {
              "part_name": { "type": "string" },
              "pages": {
                "type": "array",
                "items": { "type": "integer" }
              },
              "dimensions": {
                "type": "array",
                "items": {
                  "type": "object",
                  "properties": {
                    "feature": { "type": "string" },
                    "value": { "type": "number" },
                    "tolerance": {
                      "type": "string"
                    },
                    "unit": { "type": "string" },
                    "type": { "type": "string", "enum": ["interior", "exterior"] },
                    "dimension_type": {
                      "type": "string",
                      "enum": ["radius", "diameter", "length"]
                    },
                    "is_critical_dimension": { "type": "boolean" }
                  },
                  "required": [
                    "feature", "value", "unit",
                    "type", "dimension_type", "is_critical_dimension"
                  ]
                }
              }
            },
            "required": ["part_name", "pages", "dimensions"]
          }
        },
        "contact_pairs": {
          "type": "array",
          "items": {
            "type": "object",
            "properties": {
              "part_a": { "type": "string" },
              "feature_a": { "type": "string" },
              "value_a": { "type": "number" },
              "tolerance_a": { "type": "string" },
              "type_a": { "type": "string" },

              "part_b": { "type": "string" },
              "feature_b": { "type": "string" },
              "value_b": { "type": "number" },
              "tolerance_b": { "type": "string" },
              "type_b": { "type": "string" },

              "fit_status": {
                "type": "string",
                "enum": ["likely compatible", "tight fit", "too loose", "interference"]
              }
            },
            "required": [
              "part_a", "feature_a", "value_a", "tolerance_a", "type_a",
              "part_b", "feature_b", "value_b", "tolerance_b", "type_b",
              "fit_status"
            ]
          }
        }
      },
      "required": ["parts"]
    }
  }
}
